00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:06,000
Hello Darkness, my new friend.

2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Orion and the Dark is a animation, family, comedy
film directed by Sean Charmatz.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
A boy with an active imagination faces his fears on an unforgettable journey through
the night with his new friend: a giant, smiling creature named Dark.

4
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
Orion (voice), played by Jacob Tremblay.

5
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
Dark (voice), played by Paul Walter Hauser.

6
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Sweet Dreams (voice), played by Angela Bassett.

7
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:06,000
Adult Orion (voice), played by Colin Hanks.

8
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
Sleep (voice), played by Natasia Demetriou.

9
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Unexplained Noises (voice), played by Golda Rosheuvel.

10
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
Orion and the Dark is a 2024 American animated fantasy adventure film
written by Charlie Kaufman and directed by Sean Charmatz.

11
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Produced by DreamWorks Animation for Netflix, it is based on the 2014
children's book Orion and the Dark by Emma Yarlett.

12
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
The film stars Jacob Tremblay and Paul Walter Hauser as the titular characters, alongside the voices of Colin Hanks, Mia Akemi Brown, Ike
Barinholtz, Nat Faxon, Golda Rosheuvel, Natasia Demetriou, Aparna Nancherla, Carla Gugino, Matt Dellapina, and Angela Bassett.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
Robert Lydecker and Kevin Lax composed the film's musical score.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
Orion and the Dark premiered at the TUDUM Theater in Los Angeles on
January 27, 2024, and was released on Netflix on February 2.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
The film received positive reviews from critics.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
The film explores themes of underdog, cat, fear, based
on children's book, fear of the dark.

17
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
The tone is lighthearted and dark.
